 ffort as full-price tickets are also sold for these performances. Sales ar
 e in person only\, no phone calls. Sales start on the day of the Pay-What-
 You-Want for Mainstage and Ellen Arnold Groff performances at 4 p.m.Note t
 hat a line often forms early and must remain outside of the building. We a
 dvise checking the weather prior to arrival so that you are prepared to qu
